    "description": "Find out about everything that happens in Puerto Rico from your mobile device. On WAPA TV you will find the news from NotiCentro, Wapa Deportes, Tu Tiempo and all the exclusive content of your favorite programs from the leading channel. Here you have all the information that keeps you connected with our island, because WAPA is Puerto Rico.\r\n\r\nRemember to activate the push notification settings of your device to be informed at all times and enjoy everything that the Wapa.TV App offers you.",
